[13799]="7000324A\n1\tDerrota a Madfurr\030Derrota a Sukdyr\030Derrota a Kulgurz\tLa Aguja del Gigante se encuentra en el corazón de la zona de las Montañas Nubladas conocida como los Salones de los Gigantes, al sureste de la fortaleza enana de Gabilazan. Madfurr está al este de la Aguja del Gigante, en una grieta de la roca. Sukdyr está al noreste de la Aguja del Gigante, entre los senderos rocosos. Kulgurz está en las laderas altas sobre la Aguja del Gigante. El Elfo Golhador te ha indicado dónde se encuentran los poderosos campeones gigantes responsables de domar a los feroces mamuts.\n2\tHabla con Golhador\tGolhador está en el campamento del Risco Alto, en la parte central de las Montañas Nubladas. Golhador estará encantado de saber que has derrotado a los poderosos campeones responsables de domar a los feroces mamuts.\n",
[13800]="70047ADE\n1\tDefeat Carchost Overseers (total: 4)\tCarchost Overseers can be found within the Towers of the Teeth. You should defeat Carchost Overseers within the Towers of the Teeth.\n2\tCompletado\tDefeated many Carchost Overseers within the Towers of the Teeth.\n",
[13801]="70047454\n1\tCollect Black Númenórean artifacts\tCollect Black Númenórean artifacts within The Towers of the Teeth.\n2\tCollect Black Númenórean artifacts (total: 12)\tCollect Black Númenórean artifacts within The Towers of the Teeth.\n3\tBring the Black Númenórean artifacts to Candúr\tYou should collect Black Númenórean artifacts and bring them to Candúr.\n",
[13802]="70047463\n1\tCollect gifts of Rhûn\tCollect gifts of Rhûn within The Towers of the Teeth.\n2\tCollect gifts of Rhûn (total: 8)\tCollect gifts of Rhûn within The Towers of the Teeth.\n3\tBring the gifts of Rhûn to Thurindol\tYou should collect gifts of Rhûn and bring them to Thurindol.\n",
[13803]="70047465\n1\tDefeat Uruk-hai in The Towers of the Teeth\tDefeat Uruk-hai within The Towers of the Teeth.\n2\tDefeat Uruk-hai (total: 12)\tTo weaken the resolve of the invaders within The Towers of the Teeth, you take it upon yourself to thin their numbers.\n3\tTalk to Thurindol\tYou should return to Thurindol and inform him of your deeds within The Towers of the Teeth.\n",
[13804]="70047456\n1\tDefeat Black Númenóreans in The Towers of the Teeth\tDefeat Black Númenóreans within The Towers of the Teeth.\n2\tDefeat Black Númenóreans (total: 25)\tTo weaken the resolve of the invaders within The Towers of the Teeth, you take it upon yourself to thin their numbers.\n3\tTalk to Candúr\tYou should return to Candúr and inform him of your deeds within The Towers of the Teeth.\n",
[13805]="7004745D\n1\tDefeat Kúrgrush\tThurindol has asked you investigate the The Towers of the Teeth and find a way to discourage the invaders from remaining there.\n2\tTalk to Thurindol\tYou should return to Thurindol and apprise him of your efforts.\n",
